</comment>
                            <comment id="15325869" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 11 Jun 2016 14:12:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user astroshim commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/965&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/965&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I really appreciate your detailed review. @Leemoonsoo &lt;br/&gt;
    I will fix 1,2,3 but in case 4, &lt;br/&gt;
    I thought ```/MyNote/sub``` and ```MyNote/sub``` are the same from directory point of view.&lt;br/&gt;
    Do you think they should be treated differently?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15325891" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 11 Jun 2016 14:54:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

