&lt;p&gt;    @astroshim Thanks!&lt;br/&gt;
    `MyNote` and `/MyNote` are treated differently. And i think it&apos;s right. (compatible to previous version)&lt;br/&gt;
    Therefore I think it&apos;s more consistent to treat differently `MyNote/sub` and `/MyNote/sub`, too.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
